        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: টাক",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "টাক — ṭāk — \"a bald patch; baldness\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চল্লিশ বছরে বাবার মাথায় টাক পড়ল। chôllish bôchhôre bābār māthāy ṭāk pôṛlô. At forty, my father started going bald."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "টাক (ṭāk) পড়া, to go bald."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "টাক (ṭāk) is listed by CDIAL for Bengali, as a bald patch, under a reconstructed ṭakka, \"bald\" (CDIAL 5422); it is not the টাকা (taught) of money, which is another entry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
